  (design-system step F4, ADR-0031; ISC licence in :core:designsystem's
  assets/licenses/Lucide-ISC.txt), the app's one icon family. It replaced
  Android's stock warning triangle: a budget crossing is information, not an
  error, and the stock glyph named neither the app nor the subject.
  White on transparency for the reason the inbox icon gives.
-->
